<title>GERMANY: German Sixt sees year profits up 40-50 pct.</title>
<headline>German Sixt sees year profits up 40-50 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>German car rental firm Sixt AG, reporting a 60 percent jump in first half profits, said on Wednesday it expected full year profits to rise between 40 and 50 percent on a group turnover gain of some 25 percent.</p>
</text>
